    text: '<style="Subtitles_Format_()">Rapidly approaching bee noises</style>

      <style="Subtitles_Person_RT">RT</style>:
      Oh why is it coming closer, oh GO-'
  - displayStartTime: 23.1
    displayEndTime: 23.781
    text: '<style="Subtitles_Person_RT">RT</style>: Okay.'
  - displayStartTime: 37.727
    displayEndTime: 39.727
    text: '<style="Subtitles_Person_RT">RT</style>: I don''t know what''s happening.'
  - displayStartTime: 40.281
    displayEndTime: 43.381
    text: '<style="Subtitles_Person_RT">RT</style>: This is- this is where I live,
      um... so come on, I''ll-'
  - displayStartTime: 43.381
    displayEndTime: 45
    text: '<style="Subtitles_Person_RT">RT</style>: Yeah, I''ll sh- I''ll show you
      about.'
  - displayStartTime: 45.281
    displayEndTime: 46.609
    text: '<style="Subtitles_Person_RT">RT</style>: Hey gamers.'
  - displayStartTime: 46.609
    displayEndTime: 50.949
    text: '<style="Subtitles_Person_RT">RT</style>: It''s me, your favorite game
      developer... John Gamer.'
  - displayStartTime: 51.775
    displayEndTime: 55.489
    text: '<style="Subtitles_Person_RT">RT</style>: We wanna change the way you experience
      video games.'
  - displayStartTime: 55.489
    displayEndTime: 58.496
    text: '<style="Subtitles_Person_RT">RT</style>: Which is why, we''re excited
      to announce'
  - displayStartTime: 60.001
    displayEndTime: 60.501
    text: '<style="Subtitles_Person_RT">RT</style>: our next exciting product.'
  - displayStartTime: 60.501
    displayEndTime: 61.908
    text: '<style="Subtitles_Person_Droub">DroubGaming</style>: Who is this dude?

      <style="Subtitles_Person_RT">RT</style>:
      our next exciting product.'
  - displayStartTime: 61.908
    displayEndTime: 63.213
    text: '<style="Subtitles_Person_Droub">DroubGaming</style>: I swear the president
      was the one'
  - displayStartTime: 63.213
    displayEndTime: 63.898
    text: '<style="Subtitles_Person_Droub">DroubGaming</style>: supposed to deliver
      a speech today.

      <style="Subtitles_Person_RT">RT</style>: Wow.'
  - displayStartTime: 63.898
    displayEndTime: 65
    text: '<style="Subtitles_Person_Droub">DroubGaming</style>: supposed to deliver
      a speech today.'
  - displayStartTime: 65
    displayEndTime: 66.265
    text: '<style="Subtitles_Person_RT">RT</style>: Just look at it.'
  - displayStartTime: 68.612
    displayEndTime: 71.035
    text: '<style="Subtitles_Person_WoodmanTK">WoodmanTK</style>: Okay, I''m here.
      Now to deliver my speech.

      <style="Subtitles_Person_RT">RT</style>: We
      think this is what you, the gamer, want.'
  - displayStartTime: 71.035
    displayEndTime: 72.465
    text: '<style="Subtitles_Person_RT">RT</style>: We think this is what you, the
      gamer, want.'
  - displayStartTime: 73.05
    displayEndTime: 75.05
    text: '<style="Subtitles_Person_RT">RT</style>: And we couldn''t be happier'
